### W5-S2: List Journey Programs
GET {{host}}/api/engagement/journeys/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### W5-S2: Create Journey Program with Prerequisites
POST {{host}}/api/engagement/journeys/programs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leadership Certification Track",
  "slug": "leadership-certification-track",
  "statuses": [
    { "name": "In Progress", "colorHex": "#0F6CBD", "isCompleteStatus": false, "order": 0 },
    { "name": "Completed", "colorHex": "#107C10", "isCompleteStatus": true, "order": 1 }
  ],
  "milestoneTypes": [
    { "name": "Foundation Orientation", "code": "FOUNDATION", "order": 0 },
    { "name": "Facilitator Practicum", "code": "PRACTICUM", "order": 1, "prerequisiteCodes": [ "FOUNDATION" ] }
  ]
}

### W5-S2: Update Journey Program
PUT {{host}}/api/engagement/journeys/programs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000504
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leadership Certification Track",
  "slug": "leadership-certification-track",
  "statuses": [
    { "name": "Completed", "colorHex": "#107C10", "isCompleteStatus": true, "order": 0 }
  ],
  "milestoneTypes": [
    { "name": "Foundation Orientation", "code": "FOUNDATION", "order": 0 }
  ]
}

