### W5-S3: Create & List Support Categories
GET {{host}}/api/engagement/support/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### W5-S3: Create Support Category
POST {{host}}/api/engagement/support/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Community Mutual Aid & Care",
  "slug": "community-mutual-aid-care",
  "requiresModeration": true,
  "defaultExpirationDays": 14,
  "allowPublicCommunityWall": true
}

### W5-S3: Public Support Categories & Wall
GET {{host}}/api/engagement/public/support/categories

### W5-S3: Submit Support Request
POST {{host}}/api/engagement/public/support/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "supportCategoryId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000508",
  "firstName": "Avery",
  "lastName": "Morgan",
  "email": "avery.morgan@example.org",
  "requestText": "Recovering from surgery this week — meals or check-in appreciated.",
  "visibilityLevel": "PublicCommunityWall",
  "isUrgent": true
}

